    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The DeepSeek R1 model uses a <strong>scalable Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO)</strong> framework to optimize its performance on reasoning tasks. The model is trained on a dataset of mathematical and coding problems, and the RL algorithm encourages it to generate more tokens and explore alternative approaches. The resulting model achieves comparable performance to OpenAI's o1 model, but with significantly reduced training costs.",
